      "data": {
        "title": "Public Career",
        "body": "Joe Rogan built a career spanning stand-up comedy, television hosting, mixed-martial-arts commentary, and long-form podcasting. He began working with the UFC in 1997, later became a color commentator, and launched The Joe Rogan Experience in 2009. His official biography describes more than three decades in stand-up comedy.",
